[4.102732, "o", "Generate an isolated synthetic business and report July NRR with a receipt.\r\n"]
[7.707054, "o", "Inspect that report with the wrong date grain: the month start against a month-end report.\r\n"]
[7.707084, "o", "Create a disposable synthetic signer and a synthetic gateway with the same admission rules.\r\n"]
[7.844027, "o", "Record the finding. The proposer cannot verify its own claim; a tampered envelope never writes.\r\n"]
[7.862339, "o", "Verify both findings against the retained population. A refuted claim stays on the record.\r\n"]
[7.96371, "o", "Propose the bounded candidate and evaluate its eleven frozen cases in DuckDB against the scalar oracle.\r\n"]
[8.485993, "o", "Approval boundary: prepare the exact one-run plan; expanded, tampered or unsigned approvals fail closed.\r\n"]
[8.856102, "o", "Admit the next inspections. Only the first one after authorization may be claimed, exactly once.\r\n"]
[9.253228, "o", "Measure the claimed inspection with the candidate, record the outcome and close the one-run authority.\r\n"]
[10.010614, "o", "Reproduce the original July report and confirm the business stream holds no learning rows.\r\n"]
